    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d342-a1">

                <pb facs="0573" n="473" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg473"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 142.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">royal order.</hi></head>
                <p>In accordance with the judgment of my council of ministers, I have ordered my
                    Minister of State to present to the Cortes a project of law asking the necessary
                    authorization for the ratification of the commercial agreement between Spain and
                    the United States of America, signed at Madrid on the 2d instant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given at <placeName>Madrid</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1884-01-10">the tenth of January, one
                            thousand eight hundred and eighty-four</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>ALFONSO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The Minister of State,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Servando Ruiz
                            Gomez.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d342-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d342-a1-a1"/>
